A Python library that lowers LLVM IR -> AIR -> metallib and runs it on Apple
Silicon GPUs through Metal.


AIR is closed and undocumented, so the lowering is reverse engineered.


    test/test_llvm_to_air_matmul.py    # complete handwritten LLVM IR matmul
    $ make test                        # needs xcrun metal and xcrun metallib
    $ python3 -m unittest discover -s test -p test_llvm_to_air_unit.py  # CPU only


Reverse-engineering notes: rev-engineer.md.
